<title>TUNISIA: Tunisie Lait distributes dividends.</title>
<headline>Tunisie Lait distributes dividends.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian milk firm Tunisie Lait said it will start on Tuesday distributing a 1.0 dinar dividend per share on its 1996 results, unchanged from its level in 1995.</p>
<p>The firm had net profits of 2.44 million dinars in 1996, up from 1.33 million dinars in 1995. ($=1.1060 dinar)</p>
